{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月11日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261111.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】內地上月出口升逾三成半，進口升逾四成，是近五年半以來最大升幅，背後有甚麼原因帶動？未來走勢是怎樣？物流業界又能否受惠？</p><p>周三《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：內地進出口數據</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.861328+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:09:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:43.770181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:56.979861+00:00","content_hash":"7cba62a3452f0d0f85c9a3744434ceaeffea8e187d2dafce5fff3943e1cd12d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}